  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 306233156}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 48fb96c4990b1cf45bcb325a59cebd06, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Badeland.Runtime::Badeland.World.ReadableNote
  title: A page, pinned to the notice board
  text: 'DAY 3.


    A village! Real houses, with doors and windows, and every lantern still burning.


    Nobody is home. The beds are made. There are cups on the tables, still half full, and a pot on the fire.


    Marit says someone must tend the lamps. I said maybe that is why they stay lit.'
  radius: 3
